    ella "教职工参与其中，是为了让你能{i}彻底{/i}掌控。你是执法者。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5799
translate chinese D6_Georgia_69160ae0:

    # ella "To have control, you have to punish bad behaviour."
    ella "要掌控局面，就得惩罚不良行为。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5818
translate chinese D6_Georgia_09f2de35:

    # mc "Is that so?"
    mc "是这样吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5819
translate chinese D6_Georgia_79474720:

    # mc "Do you also set an example out of your assistants?"
    mc "你也会拿助理们开刀吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5821
translate chinese D6_Georgia_a056cd4d:

    # mc "Control, hey?"
    mc "掌控，嗯？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5822
translate chinese D6_Georgia_adb7129c:

    # mc "Do you control your assistants by punishing them?"
    mc "你通过惩罚助理们来掌控她们吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5824
translate chinese D6_Georgia_7efa0177:

    # ella "What I do, or don't do with my assistants is none of your concern."
    ella "我对助理们做什么或不做什么，不关你的事。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5826
translate chinese D6_Georgia_ce46a8f6:

    # mcT "Not what I want to hear right now."
    mcT "这话我现在不想听。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5828
translate chinese D6_Georgia_b07b8c08:

    # "You stand up, as a gesture of rebeleous confrontation."
    "你站起身，摆出一副公然对抗的架势。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5829
translate chinese D6_Georgia_1ce307a0:

    # mc "Well it is, though. Now I have [clarissa]. She's my responsibility."
    mc "可情况确实变了。我现在有[clarissa]了。她归我管。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5830
translate chinese D6_Georgia_2e89499a:

    # mc "If she messes up, I can punish her, bend her over, spank her, {w}make her my slave, {w}my pet, {w}anything goes, right?"
    mc "如果她搞砸了，我可以惩罚她，把她按倒，打她屁股，{w}让她当我的奴隶，{w}我的宠物，{w}什么都行，对吧？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5832
translate chinese D6_Georgia_f801e383:

    # mc "That goes for anyone within this college that's part of the system, right?"
    mc "这所学校里凡是纳入系统的人，都算，对吧？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5834
translate chinese D6_Georgia_8075f727:

    # mc "But if you're undermining my work, my property, that's a problem."
    mc "但你要是砸我的场子、动我的东西，那就是另一回事了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5836
translate chinese D6_Georgia_6bffcb5a:

    # "[clarissa] flinches, taken aback by your harsh words. This isn't like you, especially after your heart-to-heart earlier."
    "[clarissa]畏缩了一下，被你严厉的话吓了一跳。这不像你，尤其是你们之前还交过心。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5838
