    # mcT "..What?"
    mcT "……什么？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5877
translate chinese D6_Georgia_a63a0067:

    # ella "That's perfect, [player_name]. Perfect!"
    ella "太完美了，[player_name]。太完美了！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5878
translate chinese D6_Georgia_bd53137d:

    # ella "This is why I- {size=-12}I mean{/size}, this is why the Director brought you on board."
    ella "这就是为什么我——{size=-12}我是说{/size}，这就是为什么总监把你招了进来。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5881
translate chinese D6_Georgia_e5ddda7a:

    # ella "You undermined my authority as soon as you walked through the door."
    ella "你一踏进门就当众削我的权威。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5883
translate chinese D6_Georgia_3f40aeb0:

    # ella "And then you do it again."
    ella "然后你又来一次。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5885
translate chinese D6_Georgia_20311e2b:

    # ella "You've got balls. Steel nuggets."
    ella "你胆子够大。钢蛋一枚。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5889
translate chinese D6_Georgia_722c964b:

    # ella "You had cold feet at the start, but you warmed up to the occasion."
    ella "你一开始还畏手畏脚，后来就放开来了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5891
translate chinese D6_Georgia_ce274b55:

    # ella "This is what Sinergy needs in an Enforcer."
    ella "这就是星聚能需要的执法者。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5893
translate chinese D6_Georgia_266349d1:

    # ella "I'll let this disrespect go, this time. Redirect that energy to this Institute."
    ella "这次我不计较你的不敬。把这种劲头用到学校上吧。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5895
translate chinese D6_Georgia_7669dbc5:

    # ella "However."
    ella "不过。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5897
translate chinese D6_Georgia_7e895feb:

    # ella "If I hear any more like that. We're going to have problems. Got it?"
    ella "再让我听见这种话，我们就有的聊了。明白吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5899
translate chinese D6_Georgia_2b35b6fe_12:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5900
translate chinese D6_Georgia_dc16ebcd:

    # mc "Got it."
    mc "知道了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5903
translate chinese D6_Georgia_7e0db9b5:

    # mcT "Gotta fall in line, if I want to get to the bottom of everything."
    mcT "如果我想把一切查清楚，就得先服从。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5905
translate chinese D6_Georgia_fa99ff65:

    # ella "See, [iris], [clarissa]... This is what we want."
    ella "看到了吗，[iris]，[clarissa]……这就是我们想要的。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5907
translate chinese D6_Georgia_8932fdfe:

    # ella "Remind me to pick someone else from now on."
    ella "记得提醒我，以后改选别人。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5908
translate chinese D6_Georgia_5fb592c3:

    # ella "The two of you simply are not good enough."
    ella "你们两个根本不够格。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5910
translate chinese D6_Georgia_cf004921:

    # ella "You, especially, [iris]. I'll deal with you later."
    ella "尤其是你，[iris]。我晚点再收拾你。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5912
translate chinese D6_Georgia_7b15f7fb:

    # iris "Y-yes, Ma'am. Sorry, Ma'am..."
    iris "是、是的，夫人。抱歉，夫人……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5914
translate chinese D6_Georgia_40748d9b:

    # mcT "Shit. This isn't what I wanted to happen."
    mcT "糟了。这不是我想看到的。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5915
translate chinese D6_Georgia_97f557a1:

    # mcT "That [iris] girl is going to be punished because of me."
    mcT "那个叫[iris]的女孩要因为我受罚了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5917
translate chinese D6_Georgia_7188448d:

    # ella "And [clarissa]..."
    ella "还有[clarissa]……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5921
translate chinese D6_Georgia_c7f490b7:

    # "In your left ear, you hear the soft growls of an Apex Predator cub at the mere mention of [clarissa]."
    "一提到[clarissa]，你左耳就听到顶级掠食者幼崽般的低吼。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5923
translate chinese D6_Georgia_a400bc75:

    # mcT "Ohh..?"
    mcT "哦……？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5928
translate chinese D6_Georgia_ed673e1d:

    # mcT "Better not provoke her any further..."
    mcT "最好不要再刺激她了……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5929
translate chinese D6_Georgia_03f5bccd:

    # "You stay silent, letting the tension in the room build."
    "你保持沉默，让房间里的紧张气氛加剧。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5931
translate chinese D6_Georgia_0ec22410:

    # ella "Good, you're learning."
    ella "很好，你在学乖了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5933
translate chinese D6_Georgia_18f92079:

    # ella "Now, about [clarissa] and [iris]."
    ella "现在，说说[clarissa]和[iris]。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5935
translate chinese D6_Georgia_e0a12466:

    # ella "Do you think they're meeting our standards?"
    ella "你觉得她们达到我们的标准了吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5937
translate chinese D6_Georgia_2b35b6fe_13:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5939
translate chinese D6_Georgia_6133a08d:

    # ella "Silence is an answer too, [player_name]."
    ella "沉默也是一种回答，[player_name]。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5941
translate chinese D6_Georgia_4c2762b7:

    # mc "I mean... I've not really met [iris]. We haven't spoken..."
    mc "我是说……我其实没见过[iris]。我们没说过话……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5942
translate chinese D6_Georgia_ccc6bc4b:

    # mc "On the other hand... [clarissa] is fantastic. She's perfect. I couldn't ask for anyone better."
    mc "另一方面……[clarissa]很棒。她很完美。我找不到更好的人了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5944
translate chinese D6_Georgia_f44719a2:

    # clarissa "{size=-10}*Underbreath*{/size} P-perfect?"
    clarissa "{size=-10}*低声*{/size}完、完美？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5946
translate chinese D6_Georgia_94d1c518:

    # mc "They're doing their best."
    mc "她们在尽力了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5950
translate chinese D6_Georgia_ee900ad6:

    # ella "Best? Their best is not enough."
    ella "尽力？她们尽力还不够。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5952
translate chinese D6_Georgia_8228afd7:

    # ella "I expect excellence. Anything less is unacceptable."
    ella "我要求卓越。任何低于这个标准都是不可接受的。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5954
translate chinese D6_Georgia_503de4d9:

    # ella "[clarissa], you need to show more initiative. This passive attitude won't cut it."
    ella "[clarissa]，你得更有主动性。这种被动态度不行。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5958
translate chinese D6_Georgia_c7f490b7_1:

    # "In your left ear, you hear the soft growls of an Apex Predator cub at the mere mention of [clarissa]."
    "一提到[clarissa]，你左耳就听到顶级掠食者幼崽般的低吼。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5960
translate chinese D6_Georgia_0c95b8db:

    # mcT "Oooh..?"
    mcT "噢……？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5962
translate chinese D6_Georgia_4edf68f2:

    # ella "[iris], you're too timid. We need strength, not weakness."
    ella "[iris]，你太胆小了。我们需要的是力量，不是软弱。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5964
translate chinese D6_Georgia_7b15f7fb_1:

    # iris "Y-yes, Ma'am. Sorry, Ma'am..."
    iris "是、是的，夫人。对不起，夫人……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5966
translate chinese D6_Georgia_8932fdfe_1:

    # ella "Remind me to pick someone else from now on."
    ella "记得提醒我，以后改选别人。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5968
translate chinese D6_Georgia_39e1ff07:

    # ella "Both of you are skating on thin ice."
    ella "你们两个都在走钢丝。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5969
translate chinese D6_Georgia_9ae80666:

    # ella "I'll be watching you closely. Any more failures, and there will be consequences."
    ella "我会紧紧盯着你们。再有任何失误，后果自负。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5971
translate chinese D6_Georgia_7af6bd81:

    # mcT "She's really laying into them. I need to figure out a way to get them out of there."
    mcT "她真是把她们骂得狗血淋头。我得想办法把她们从那救出来。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5972
translate chinese D6_Georgia_81fcd50f:

    # mcT "Just do as I'm told, get results as [school_name]'s Enforcer..."
    mcT "按照吩咐行事，作为[school_name]的执法者取得成果……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5973
translate chinese D6_Georgia_16b66bd5:

    # mcT "Once I have a good standing, attempt to bargain?" id D6_Georgia_16b66bd5
    mcT "等我站稳了脚跟，再去试着讨价还价？" id D6_Georgia_16b66bd5

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5974
translate chinese D6_Georgia_8e00ffd1:

    # mcT "Get them the fuck out of there, and find out what the fuck Sinergy actually wants with this PARE system."
    mcT "把她们他妈的全都弄出去，再搞清楚星聚能到底想拿这个赏罚系统干什么。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5975
translate chinese D6_Georgia_4ab5fbef:

    # mcT "I can't let [ella] get a wiff of anything. If that happens, I'm fucked."
    mcT "我绝不能让[ella]听到半点风声。要是被她知道了，我就完蛋了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5977
translate chinese D6_Georgia_6ed843a7:

    # mcT "I'm too new. I have no sway in anything..."
    mcT "我刚来，对任何事情都没有影响力……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5979
translate chinese D6_Georgia_44f055a7:

    # mcT "Fuck."
    mcT "操。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5980
translate chinese D6_Georgia_0c7fc4ee:

    # mcT "I hate feeling powerless. Especially when people I care about are involved."
    mcT "我讨厌这种无能为力的感觉，尤其是当我关心的人被牵扯进来的时候。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5982
translate chinese D6_Georgia_c37ac1ec:

    # mcT "So much for a peaceful job..."
    mcT "这份清闲工作算是泡汤了……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5984
translate chinese D6_Georgia_75e17416:

    # ella "Enough introspection, [player_name]. You've been quiet for far too long."
    ella "别再自我反省了，[player_name]。你沉默得太久了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5986
translate chinese D6_Georgia_0baa3f0d:

    # ella "I want to see if you can actually handle the responsibilities of an Enforcer."
    ella "我想看看你究竟能不能胜任执法者的职责。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5988
translate chinese D6_Georgia_b2b9e19d:

    # mc "What do you mean?"
    mc "你这话是什么意思？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5996
translate chinese D6_Georgia_d45592df:

    # ella "{i}I mean,{/i} an impromptu inspection. That's why I'm here."
    ella "{i}我是说，{/i}临时突击检查。我来就是为了这个。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:5998
translate chinese D6_Georgia_72d377ed:

    # ella "How do you handle discipline? How do you manage these students?"
    ella "你是怎么处理纪律问题的？又是怎么管理这些学生的？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6000
translate chinese D6_Georgia_da09a448:

    # ella "I didn't think I would be sat twiddling my thumbs for a few hours waiting..."
    ella "我可没想到自己得在这搓着手干等上好几个小时……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6002
translate chinese D6_Georgia_0bb3f74e:

    # ella "And that brings me onto the dog."
    ella "说到这，我得提一下那条狗。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6004
translate chinese D6_Georgia_297449ba:

    # ella "Do the rules mean nothing to you?"
    ella "你眼里还有规矩吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6006
translate chinese D6_Georgia_4cef6a3f:

    # ella "Do you know why we're separating the girls from the boys, hmm?"
    ella "你知道我们为什么要把女生和男生分开吗，嗯？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6008
translate chinese D6_Georgia_8aa47df5:

    # mc "No, I don't. [principal] told me Sinergy implemented it, but didn't say why."
    mc "不，我不知道。[principal]告诉我这是星聚能的规定，但没说原因。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6010
translate chinese D6_Georgia_8d7914e6:

    # ella "Typical."
    ella "果然。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6012
translate chinese D6_Georgia_71f9cd5c:

    # ella "Boys are a distraction. It's as simple as that. Do you really think these girls are going to focus on their studies with boys around, vying for their attention?"
    ella "男生就是干扰源，就这么简单。你真觉得有男生在旁边争抢她们的注意力时，这些女生还能专心学习吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6014
translate chinese D6_Georgia_cb1aecb0:

    # ella "No. They lose focus. They falter. And under our system, faltering isn't an option."
    ella "不可能。她们会分心，会动摇。而在我们的系统里，动摇是绝不允许的。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6016
translate chinese D6_Georgia_fd677eee:

    # ella "Discipline and control is everything. These students are here to grow, to learn, to become what we need them to be—and that requires focus and interjection from the Enforcer if they stray from that path."
    ella "纪律和控制就是一切。这些学生来这里是为了成长、学习，成为我们需要他们成为的人——而如果他们偏离了这条路，就需要执法者的干预和纠正。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6017
translate chinese D6_Georgia_a4427787:

    # mcT "What they need them to be?"
    mcT "成为他们需要成为的人？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6019
translate chinese D6_Georgia_742661a7:

    # ella "Rules aren't there just for the sake of it. They're there to keep them on track."
    ella "规矩不是摆设，是为了让他们别跑偏。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6021
translate chinese D6_Georgia_279eea04:

    # ella "If the Enforcer can't follow a simple rule, if {i}you{/i} can't show discipline yourself, how are the students supposed to? They look to you as an example."
    ella "如果执法者连一条简单的规矩都遵守不了，如果{i}你{/i}自己都做不到自律，那学生们又怎么能做到呢？他们可是以你为榜样的。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6022
translate chinese D6_Georgia_cf916c4c:

    # ella "If they see you breaking the rules, they'll think it's acceptable to do the same."
    ella "如果他们看到你违反规矩，他们就会觉得这么做是可以接受的。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6024
translate chinese D6_Georgia_9a559d86:

    # ella "We can't afford chaos. This institute is about structure. Without it, we lose everything."
    ella "我们不能容忍混乱。这个学院的核心就是秩序。没有秩序，我们就会失去一切。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:6026
