    announcer "最后是[lily]！后场是她的天下，作为最后一道防线，她准备深挖防守，让球一直飞下去！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7263
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_2c40b579:

    # announcer "On the other side of the court, we have..?"
    announcer "球场另一边是……？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7264
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_b96724a8:

    # geo "[d6_geoTeam]!"
    geo "[d6_geoTeam]！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7268
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_d5f3f94d:

    # announcer "[d6_geoTeam]! A team that combines subtlety with surprising strength, ready to take on any challenge!"
    announcer "[d6_geoTeam]！一支将细腻与惊人力量结合的队伍，准备好迎接任何挑战！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7274
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_477a2712:

    # announcer "Leading the charge is [geo], always ready with a clever quip and a killer serve to keep her foes on their toes!"
    announcer "带头的是[geo]，她总是能用机智的俏皮话和致命的发球，让对手措手不及！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7282
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_970ffc93:

    # announcer "[morg], shy but steady, brings her cool-headed determination to the front lines, ready to block and volley like a pro!"
    announcer "[morg]，害羞但稳健，带着冷静的决心来到前线，准备像职业选手一样拦网和截击！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7290
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_8a8e85de:

    # announcer "And [chrissy], the unexpected powerhouse! Despite the... {i}unique{/i} choice of attire, she's here to show that even in her panties, she's ready to spike the competition down to size!"
    announcer "还有[chrissy]，出人意料的强力选手！尽管穿着{i}独特{/i}的服装，她还是要证明，即使穿着内裤，她也能把对手打得落花流水！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7295
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_da2a5f6c:

    # mc "You're pretty good at that. Ever thought about being a caster?"
    mc "你挺在行的嘛。有没有考虑过去当解说员？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7297
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_bf02313a:

    # ver "Oh behave, haha. It's all for the competition!"
    ver "别闹了，哈哈。这都是为了比赛！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7299
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_cb995083:

    # ver "We're about to start, so listen up!"
    ver "我们马上开始了，都听好了！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7301
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_80a1b6e9:

    # ver "Captains! Meet at the center. It's time for the game of games!"
    ver "队长们！到中间来。是时候开始这场巅峰对决了！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7303
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_332c6828:

    # announcer "Rock-paper-scissors."
    announcer "石头剪刀布。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7306
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_25d7b126:

    # announcer "The winner serves first. No best two-out-of-three."
    announcer "赢家先发球。不搞三局两胜。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7307
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_ae163f31:

    # announcer "This serve will set the tone for the whole game, so make it count!"
    announcer "这次发球将为整场比赛定调，所以好好把握！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7310
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_dd279783:

    # "They lock eyes, each one sizing up the competition..."
    "她们对视着，各自打量着对手……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7312
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_96c6d1ff:

    # "Each knowing that the first serve can be a game-changer."
    "她们都知道，第一球可能就改写整场比赛。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7315
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_cd8fb247:

    # announcer "Rock."
    announcer "石头。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7318
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_af889c34:

    # announcer "Paper."
    announcer "布。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7321
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_5cf2fe6d:

    # announcer "Scissors."
    announcer "剪刀。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7323
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_6d5215fe:

    # announcer "Shoot!"
    announcer "出！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7327
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_291820d9:

    # suz "Suck it, nerd! I win!"
    suz "认输吧，书呆子！我赢了！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7329
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_790e3e1d:

    # suz "Sorry, Gogo. There are no friends on the court. Game's the game." id D6_Chrissy_790e3e1d
    suz "抱歉，娅娅。球场上没有朋友。比赛就是比赛。" id D6_Chrissy_790e3e1d

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7331
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_0ca694b8:

    # geo "Funny, I was thinking the same thing. Don't call me Gogo when you're the one who's gonna lose!"
    geo "有意思，我也正想这么说。等你要输的时候，可别叫我娅娅！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7333
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_deb4bfa0:

    # announcer "First to three points wins!"
    announcer "先得三分者获胜！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7335
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_fa321a56:

    # clarissa "Sir.. Why is she holding the ruler like a microphone?"
    clarissa "先生……为什么她像拿着麦克风一样拿着尺子？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7337
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_941ab60b:

    # mc "I don't know, [clarissa]. Just roll with it. She's in the zone."
    mc "我不知道，[clarissa]。就随她去吧。她已经进入状态了。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7339
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_c2b4198d:

    # announcer "Are you ready?"
    announcer "准备好了吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7342
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_c39809d2:

    # "[d6_suzTeam]" "Born ready!"
    "[d6_suzTeam]" "生来就准备好了！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7345
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_f7388008:

    # "[d6_geoTeam]" "Ready!"
    "[d6_geoTeam]" "准备好了！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7347
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_08fb3fcd:

    # announcer "{i}I said{/i}, are you {sc=2}{b}READY{/b}{/sc}!?"
    announcer "{i}我说了{/i}，你{sc=2}{b}准备好了吗{/b}{/sc}！？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7350
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_61716ea4:

    # "[d6_suzTeam] {color=#ffffff}&{/color} [d6_geoTeam]" "{sc=2}{b}READY{/b}{/sc}!"
    "[d6_suzTeam] {color=#ffffff}&{/color} [d6_geoTeam]" "{sc=2}{b}准备好了{/b}{/sc}！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7353
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_5a886f9a:

    # announcer "{b}THREE.{/b}"
    announcer "{b}3{/b}"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7355
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_0aa8e6ff:

    # announcer "{b}TWO.{/b}"
    announcer "{b}2{/b}"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7357
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_b0ae75af:

    # announcer "{b}ONE.{/b}"
    announcer "{b}1{/b}"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7360
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_63e8e896:

    # announcer "And here we go, folks! The match is about to start, and the tension in the air is palpable! [suz] is stepping up to serve for the [d6_suzTeam]!"
    announcer "各位观众，比赛即将开始，紧张的气氛几乎可以触摸到！[suz]正准备为[d6_suzTeam]发球！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7362
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_765b563f:

    # announcer "The crowd {i}{size=-10}(of four people){/size}{/i} watches in anticipation as [suz] prepares her serve, the ball gripped firmly in her hand."
    announcer "观众{i}{size=-10}（一共四个人）{/size}{/i}满怀期待地注视着[suz]准备发球，她手中的球握得紧紧的。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7364
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_e34014f7:

    # announcer "There's the serve! A powerful shot from [suz], sending the ball rocketing over the net and aiming for the back court of the [d6_geoTeam]!"
    announcer "发球来了！[suz]一记强力发球，球飞速越过球网，直冲[d6_geoTeam]的后场！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7367
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_827d7d48:

    # "The ball is rapid, like a torpedo, heading straight toward's The Sinker!" id D6_Chrissy_827d7d48
    "球速飞快，像鱼雷一样，直奔「沉船者」而去！" id D6_Chrissy_827d7d48

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7370
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_11186930:

    # announcer "She stumbles a bit, but manages to bump the ball into the air!"
    announcer "她稍微踉跄了一下，但还是成功将球垫了起来！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7373
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_f4447e2a:

    # announcer "A nice spike from [geo]!"
    announcer "[geo]一记漂亮的扣杀！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7376
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_bb2291d3:

    # announcer "Quickly shot down by Volley Vixen's captain [suz]!"
    announcer "网前女王队队长[suz]迅速反击，将球扣了回去！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7378
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_e1740fe8:

    # chrissy "Ahh.."
    chrissy "啊……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7383
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_da448a8b:

    # chrissy "S-stop looking!"
    chrissy "别……别看了！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7420
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_906dd1b3:

    # announcer "{sc=2}PERFECT HIT!{/sc} The ball darts over the net!" with vpunch
    announcer "{sc=2}完美一击！{/sc}球飞速过网！" with vpunch

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7425
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_d47fdf71:

    # announcer "[raya] swoops in for the spike! The ball is heading straight for the ground!"
    announcer "[raya]迅速冲上前扣杀！球直奔地面而去！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7429
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_95c016ec:

    # announcer "Incredible! [chrissy] picks up the courage and dives forward with a stunning save, keeping the ball in play with a well-timed bump. The Net Ninjas aren't giving up just yet!"
    announcer "太不可思议了！[chrissy]鼓起勇气，一个漂亮的鱼跃救球，将球稳稳垫起，比赛继续！网前忍者队还没放弃呢！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7435
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_c3860870:

    # announcer "The ball hangs over The Sinker! What will she do? The Net Ninja's are down one player and she's too far from the net for a power spike!"
    announcer "球悬在「沉船者」头顶！她会怎么做？网前忍者队少了一名队员，而她离网太远，无法强力扣杀！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7437
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_b168ee43:

    # announcer "[morg] jumps and bumps it with all her might. This could be it!"
    announcer "[morg]全力跳起，将球垫了过去。这可能是关键一击！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7440
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_efa1920b:

    # "The ball zips over the net, aiming for the center of the court."
    "球飞速过网，直奔球场中央！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7445
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_92583ae9:

    # announcer "But wait! [suz] is there instantly to block the defence, hitting the ball straight down."
    announcer "但等等！[suz]瞬间赶到，拦网成功，将球直接扣了下去！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7454
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_1da02cbd:

    # "[suz]'s team cheers as they claim the first point of the game."
    "[suz]的队友们欢呼起来，她们拿下了比赛的第一分！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7457
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_b3482761:

    # suz "Good job team!"
    suz "干得好，队友们！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7459
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_2d9c043f:

    # raya "If we lose, I'll kill you."
    raya "如果我们输了，我就宰了你们。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7461
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_35dd48f9:

    # suz "Competitive! I like it. [raya]."
    suz "很有竞争意识！我喜欢。[raya]。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7463
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_0e72a4c6:

    # suz "Apart from the killing part."
    suz "除了「宰了你们」那部分。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7465
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_a70c251b:

    # raya "Make sure we win then."
    raya "那就确保我们赢吧。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7467
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_99fa4728:

    # suz "'You okay in the back, [lily]?"
    suz "你在后面还好吗，[lily]？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7469
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_8afb9ad4:

    # lily "Yep! I like playing defence, you two are too good! I hardly get to do anything."
    lily "嗯！我喜欢防守，你们两个太厉害了！我几乎没什么事可做。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7471
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_41e0b7a9:

    # lily "We're gonna win easily at this pace!"
    lily "照这个节奏，我们就能轻易取胜！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7473
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_47fae87b:

    # geo "Win? No chance. The victory will be for [d6_geoTeam]!"
    geo "赢？没门儿。胜利属于[d6_geoTeam]！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7475
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_9644c779:

    # suz "Hooo?"
    suz "哦？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7476
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_687a93fa:

    # raya "Want to put a bet who wins?"
    raya "想打个赌，看谁赢吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7486
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_f5b10ddb:

    # "The [d6_geoTeam] look at each other with determination gleaming in their eyes, and each gave a subtle nod to their captain."
    "[d6_geoTeam]的队员们互相看了一眼，眼中闪烁着坚定的光芒，每个人都向队长微微点头。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7488
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_90485667:

    # geo "Alright, y-you're on!"
    geo "好，你……你等着瞧吧！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7490
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_bc3a521a:

    # "Each team huddle around, whispering what the losing team should do."
    "每支队伍围成一圈，低声讨论输的队伍该做什么。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7492
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_372b2a81:

    # "A few moments pass, and they both come to a verdict."
    "过了一会，双方都达成了共识。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7494
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_b19327c9:

    # announcer "Are we ready, girls?"
    announcer "姑娘们，准备好了吗？"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7497
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_6632c6a2:

    # geo "Ready, Mrs. Valentine!"
    geo "准备好了，瓦伦丁夫人！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7500
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_9eca68e0:

    # suz "Ready to win!"
    suz "准备赢啦！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7504
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_1deb0b81:

    # announcer "Match two {sc=2}{b}START!{/b}{/sc}{p=3.5}{nw}"
    announcer "第二场比赛 {sc=2}{b}开始！{/b}{/sc}{p=3.5}{nw}"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7508
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_51bdfcd8:

    # announcer "The match continues, the two teams launching the ball at one another." id D6_Chrissy_51bdfcd8
    announcer "比赛继续，两队你来我往。" id D6_Chrissy_51bdfcd8

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7509
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_819c8da4:

    # announcer "The atmosphere is intense, each players' determination to win is shown in their astute play style." id D6_Chrissy_819c8da4
    announcer "气氛紧张，每位选手的求胜决心都体现在她们精湛的球技里。" id D6_Chrissy_819c8da4

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7516
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_16066f6e:

    # announcer "It's close, but the second point of the game goes to the [d6_geoTeam]!!"
    announcer "比分紧咬，但第二分由[d6_geoTeam]拿下！！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7519
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_acaf7d9f:

    # mc "Oof, [lily] was so close to bumping that rocket from [geo]!"
    mc "哎呀，[lily]差点就接住了[geo]的那记火箭球！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7521
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_a6fdb53c:

    # clarissa "Mhmm... It's a nice game, sir."
    clarissa "嗯……比赛很精彩，先生。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7524
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_d1b9881f:

    # announcer "The third and final match has begun! [suz] leaps for a powerful spike, but [geo] expertly deflects it with a well-timed block. The ball ricochets off, and [raya] scrambles to get it back into play."
    announcer "第三场——也是最后一场——开始了！[suz]跃起一记强力扣杀，但[geo]精准拦网，把球挡了回去。球弹飞出去，[raya]奋力将球救回场内。"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7528
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_63e518c7:

    # announcer "Net Ninja's captain, [geo] sets up for a decisive attack off of the back of [morg]'s handy-work!" id D6_Chrissy_63e518c7
    announcer "网前忍者队队长[geo]在[morg]的巧妙助攻下，准备发起决定性的一击！" id D6_Chrissy_63e518c7

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7535
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_98b69fb8:

    # announcer "[geo] delivers a flawless spike, and the ball sails over the net with precision. The [d6_suzTeam] are caught off guard, unable to return it!"
    announcer "[geo]一记完美的扣杀，球精准地飞过球网。[d6_suzTeam]措手不及，无法回击！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7539
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_81740bc6:

    # announcer "{bt=2}Aaannnnnd{/bt} that's game!{p=3.5}{nw}"
    announcer "{bt=2}啊啊——{/bt}比赛结束！{p=3.5}{nw}"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7541
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_447844ab:

    # announcer "The [d6_geoTeam] take the match with a stunning final point. Congratulations to [geo], [morg] and [chrissy]!"
    announcer "[d6_geoTeam]靠最后一球漂亮绝杀，赢下了比赛。恭喜[geo]、[morg]和[chrissy]！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7545
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_e65294ef:

    # ver "Good game, everyone! What a ride!"
    ver "大家打得漂亮！真是场精彩的比赛！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7546
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_8ec8a69f:

    # ver "Class is over, I'll see you all tomorrow!"
    ver "下课啦，大家明天见！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7548
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_5240e06f:

    # mc "That was intense! [ver] was right, what a game!"
    mc "太激烈了！[ver]说得对，真是场精彩的比赛！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7550
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_aa4fd8de:

    # suz "Yeah... Sucks that we lost though..."
    suz "是啊……可惜我们输了……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7553
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_16c3f7d4:

    # geo "{i}Suck it, nerd!{/i}"
    geo "{i}认输吧，书呆子！{/i}"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7556
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_b558f4fb:

    # morg "I.. I can't believe we won..!"
    morg "我……我简直不敢相信我们赢了……！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7558
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_0bd57c53:

    # mcT "Damn. She's been sweating so much her shirt's drenched!"
    mcT "该死。她出了太多汗，衬衫都湿透了！"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7559
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_87a279d7:

    # mcT "I can see everything..."
    mcT "我什么都看得一清二楚……"

# game/Days/daySix.rpy:7561
translate chinese D6_Chrissy_70732eb0:

    # mc "[morg]... You might want to take a shower..."
